1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Nabi

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,040
kata

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,160
apa?

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:08,126
Al-muslimu man salimal muslimuna min

5
00:00:08,126 --> 00:00:09,580
lisanihi wa yadih.

6
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,850
Muslim yang baik ialah muslim lain

7
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,960
rasa selamat dengan dia pada

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,940
lidahnya dan tangannya.

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,510
Bila orang lain rasa selamat tentang

10
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:24,070
kita ni, pada lidah kita dan

11
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,480
tangan kita.

12
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,760
Adakah orang yang kita rasa tak selamat?

13
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,940
Lidah dia dan tangannya.

14
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,140
Ada.

15
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,450
Tak nak pergi jumpa Mok Cu,

16
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,780
