19
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:46,565
Kita tak kahwin-kahwin.

20
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,270
Cerita tak ada lain, cerita bila

21
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:50,660
nak beranak.

22
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:55,260
Jadi kita kena bagi khabar gembira,

23
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,580
jangan menyakitkan

24
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,600
hati orang.

25
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:04,100
Muslim yang baik ialah apabila

26
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:06,220
muslim lain rasa selamat dengan dia

27
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:07,760
pada lidah dan tangannya.

28
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,470
Hai, nak pergi tak?

29
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:12,300
Pergilah raya rumah Mok Cu.

30
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,200
Kenapa?

31
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,370
Eh, eh,

32
00:01:14,890 --> 00:01:16,990
Mok Cu bagus.

33
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:24,400
Cakap pun yang elok-elok je.

34
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:27,620
Puji, bagi nasihat elok-elok.

35
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:31,130
Kalau dikata-kata, mana orang nak

36
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:33,700
